        "Instruments are registered in the order listed: the near contract, then the next. The roll session is one session before the near expiry (the default): 2025-07-30.",
        "The strategy names the underlying and the contract rank (underlying NIFTY on NFO, expiry current_month), as the frozen contract has it (14-strategy-api 2.1, SPEC-30); the fixture lists the contracts it trades in settings.roll.chain. strategy_bars are the bars on_bar receives, recorded as they were when used: the near contract's bars up to 2025-07-29 and the next contract's from the roll session on (04-execution 7).",
        "max_daily_loss is a run argument (14-strategy-api 5.1, SPEC-23).",
        "Positional model (04-execution 4.4, 14-strategy-api 2.4): the stop of an NRML position is held as a SINGLE GTT, placed as soon as the entry fills; a trail modifies it (a full replacement, effective from the next base bar, at most once per base bar, GTT-3). The GTT events and the fill field gtt_id are the fixture's vocabulary for a life cycle the documents describe but do not name (GTT-8). At the roll the near contract's GTT is cancelled before the near leg is closed, and a new GTT with the shifted trigger is placed on the next contract after its fill (GTT-9).",
        "The trail is armed before the roll and is the continuous form, so after the roll its level depends only on the shifted extreme, not on which entry price the position refers to (SPEC-20).",
        "The entry bar (2025-07-28) has high equal to open (SPEC-01 does not matter).",
        "On the roll day the next contract's high 25260.00 is above the unshifted extreme 25180.00 but below the shifted one 25275.00. A kernel that forgets to shift the extreme would move the stop; a kernel that forgets to shift the stop would not exit on 2025-07-31 (low 25170.00 against 25080.00).",
        "The daily loss limit of 10000 is active and never breached: the run's gross MTM at the four closes is -3750.00, 10500.00, 10125.00 and 5250.00.",
        "The roll fills come in step 2 after any strategy order, near leg first, both with reason roll, with position events only (SPEC-19, now 04-execution 7).",
        "On 2025-07-31 the GTT's trigger 25175.00 is reached inside the range (the open 25230.00 is above it); its child sell LIMIT 25175.00 x 0.99 = 24923.25 is marketable at the trigger and fills there (GTT-5)."
